00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:16.990
Huh?

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:26.330
A Treaty Regarding the Allocation of Peter Grill's Reproductive Resources

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:32.050
<i>A-Are they about to strike a deal over my crotch!?</i>

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:43.060
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:49.110
Dug myself into a hole with no way out

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.610
Back against the wall...

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.450
I mean, how could I resist?

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:57.160
"This wasn't supposed to happen,"

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:58.740
I keep denying

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:00.200
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:01.370
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:01.870
I wish I could just disappear...

00:01:01.870 --> 00:01:04.830
I can't stand myself

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.250
Moping around, spouting lies, grieving a broken heart

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.210
I hold on desperately to these feelings and shut my eyes

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.670
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.670
So why does this stupid guilt refuse to go away!?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:18.300
I suffocate under its weight

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:22.220
The chance to be a hero is long gone...

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:25.640
Always discouraged by my weaknesses,

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.860
I drop to my knees and grovel at your feet,

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.860
clinging selfishly to the hope for forgiveness

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:35.200
Dug myself into a hole with no way out...

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.450
Full of regret and powerless to change,

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.700
I feel my heart being torn apart

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:45.460
on this night of endless shame and despair

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:54.670
Why can't I get my act together?

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:00.800
Got nothing but this pathetic self of mine...

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:05.430
'S-Scuse me...

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:08.770
Can anyone hear me...?

00:02:10.370 --> 00:02:12.270
Using magic oughtta be banned!

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.150
That impact play of yours
is what ought to be banned!

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:20.530
Episode\h     Peter Grill and the Secret Treaty

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:19.430
It stimulates the flow of Senpai's slam chowder!

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:17.580
Uh...

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:19.430
Ladies...?

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.640
Well, my magic can control the way he shoots his goo–

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:21.640
Hello...!?

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:23.260
M-More importantly...

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:26.270
I'd like to point out a major issue with this schedule.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:27.420
It's biased in your favor!

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.160
How observant of you.

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.130
It seems you're more than just
a walking pair of boobs, after all...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.260
Unlike that wimpy, long-eared freak over there!

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.800
Who're you calling <i>wimpy!?</i>

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:39.580
Hey...!

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:42.190
Then let us reassess the agreement

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.580
and create a final draft
once we've reached a consensus.{the council has begun}

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.750
Uh, what about me?

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:45.040
Fine.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.500
Agreed.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.400
Roger!

00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:48.770
C'mon, are you listening!?

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:49.910
Don't I get a say!?

00:02:49.910 --> 00:02:51.800
Am I invisible or something!?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.030
<i>Gimme a damn break, would you!?</i>

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:58.240
{=5}Note:
The "right to veto" possessed by Peter Grill
is assumed to be largely non-existent.

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:58.070
<i>Gimme a damn break, would you!?</i>

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:58.110
<i>Gimme a damn break, would you!?</i>

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:58.150
<i>Gimme a damn break, would you!?</i>

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:04.620
The terms introduced by a unilateral
interspecies treaty were enforced thereafter.

00:03:05.570 --> 00:03:07.320
In accordance with the treaty,

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:11.880
Peter Grill carried out his usual, rigorous duties on a daily basis.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.130
Until...

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:19.550
...the first day of rest following the
treaty's enactment had finally arrived.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.070
What's up, Peter?

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:28.300
You're in a good mood, gettin' all decked out...

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:30.940
Why, I'm glad you asked, Tim!

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.940
Today is a rest day, as established by the treaty.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:39.320
I'm going to revel in my freedom and spend some quality time with Luvellia-senpai...!

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.370
I'm well aware of your situation.

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:45.970
A long-overdue date...

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:47.200
Have fun, dude.

00:03:56.680 --> 00:03:58.590
Hello, Peter-kun.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.090
I hope...

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.430
...you weren't waiting for too long.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.310
Is something the matter?

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.060
N-No, it's just...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.800
You look even more beautiful than usual.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:12.020
I couldn't help but stare...

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:17.400
As the old saying goes,
"Flattery will get you nowhere."

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:18.820
Shall we?

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.740
<i>I'm in heaven...</i>

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.740
<i>When I'm with Luvellia-senpai,</i>

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.220
<i>I feel at peace...</i>

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:53.530
The food here is exquisite, is it not?

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:56.900
As long as you like it,
that's all that matters.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:05:00.350
Some of the guys down at the Guild
rave about this place.

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:06.380
I apologize for dragging you along
on my shopping trip, Peter-kun.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:07.490
Oh, don't mention it.

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:10.110
I had a great time today.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.220
To our future.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:18.500
May it be bright.

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:24.830
Your hand...

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:26.880
You still have a scar.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.200
How shameful of me...

00:05:29.990 --> 00:05:31.790
Carelessly leaving a mark

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.850
on the world's strongest warrior like that...

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.020
This scar is a badge of honor.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:43.140
And it's the reason why I get to spend
this type of quality time with my beloved senpai.

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:48.000
But you used to despise me back then, didn't you?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:51.080
Don't tease me like that, Senpai.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:57.020
<i>I wish this moment would last forever...</i>

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.520
No way!

00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.700
Is that you over there, Senpai!?

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.300
What a coinkydink!

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:09.050
<i>Is this a joke!?</i>

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.630
<i>What the hell is she doing here...!?</i>

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:14.530
Are you on a date, Senpai?

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.710
W-Well...

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:19.510
What do you want?

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:21.300
Today's a rest day, right...?

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.490
The heck are you talkin' about, Senpai!?

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:26.720
Now's the perfect time
to get a jump on those other guys.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:29.720
That way, I get to hog your hog
all to myself, y'know!?

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:32.540
Listen here, you...!

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:36.450
Isn't the whole point of a contract
to obey the damn thing!?

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.210
W-Wait! Senpai–!

00:06:41.390 --> 00:06:46.380
You and this young Ogre seem to have become
quite close friends lately, Peter-kun.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.050
Th-That's right!

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:49.620
She asked for my help with combat training.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.900
It's been a real hands-on process...

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:52.550
Oh?

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.180
You're kiddin', right?

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.980
The only hand involved in that process
is mine wrapped around your–

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.410
You're comin' with me!

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:01.990
Please excuse us for a moment, Luvellia-senpai.

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:02.520
Sure...

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.700
C'mon, cut me some slack!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.520
This date is a big deal.
Don't blow it for me!

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:10.610
Then how's about we start off with a quickie?

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.940
That'll keep me happy for a while!

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:14.030
Don't say "start off with" like it's an appetizer!

00:07:16.260 --> 00:07:17.520
<i>A-Although...</i>

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.120
<i>If she keeps hanging around,</i>

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:23.140
<i>the short time I have left with
Luvellia-senpai will go to waste...</i>

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:24.340
Wow!

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.720
Senpai...!

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:29.590
<i>A-And once again...</i>

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:30.930
See ya!

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.600
<i>I've committed yet another heinous act of betrayal...</i>

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:39.320
<i>I'd better hurry back before she gets suspicious...!</i>

00:07:40.360 --> 00:07:41.690
<i>You got this!</i>

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.330
Luvellia-senpai!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:48.550
<i>Of course she's here too!</i>

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.530
For today, let's start off with something quick and easy.

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:56.090
What about my rest day...!?

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:01.150
A rest day is the perfect time to get
a jump on those other guys!

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.040
A rest day is perfect.

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:06.340
The others won't interrupt us.

