00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:16.420
It seems you and this Elf have grown
quite close with each other lately, Peter-kun.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:17.630
Y-Yeah...

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:19.460
Fate has a twisted sense of humor...

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.200
Bye for now!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.580
<i>O-Okay...</i>

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.770
<i>I somehow convinced her to leave...</i>

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.690
Luvellia-senpai!

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.860
<i>God dammit!</i>

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.740
S-Sir!? {what a catch}

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.530
I-It's no use...

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.070
<i>They're a total disaster...!</i>

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:44.460
<i></i>None<i> of them have any intention of following the rules...!</i>

00:09:01.600 --> 00:09:02.840
<i>Peter Grill!</i>

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:06.180
<i>You are far too concerned with the pursuit of strength!</i>

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:10.020
<i>Settling for second best isn't the
right attitude for a captain!</i>

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.140
D-Damn it...!

00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:18.450
Look out, Captain!

00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:25.990
I'm just glad you're safe...

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:28.540
Luvellia-senpai...

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.000
Peter-kun...

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.800
Perhaps I've had too much wine...

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:46.200
I had a wonderful time today, Peter-kun.

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:49.850
I'm sorry for letting them ruin our date...

00:09:49.850 --> 00:09:50.620
Not at all.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:53.780
As the world's strongest warrior,
your popularity is only natural.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.230
N-Nah...

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:03.430
Well, I must bid you good night.

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:06.560
Father tends to make a fuss when I return home late.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.460
O-Of course.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.710
Y-You're right...

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.500
The Guildmaster can be...

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.130
kind of a worrywart.

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:19.960
I wouldn't mind going on a trip together
outside of our Guild duties.

00:10:20.510 --> 00:10:21.830
Just the two of us...

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.930
Somewhere calm and relaxing...

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.930
Th-That sounds nice...

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.140
<i>Should I stop her?</i>

00:10:33.640 --> 00:10:35.940
<i>Letting her leave with this
awkwardness between us...</i>

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:41.660
<i>Luvellia-senpai...!</i>

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.460
<i>Sir Peter!</i>

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:49.080
<i>Nut butter...!</i>

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.330
<i>If something doesn't change...</i>

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:54.920
<i>I'm not sure how much longer I'll be able to endure their torture</i>

00:10:54.920 --> 00:11:00.010
<i>and still manage to protect 
my relationship with Luvellia-senpai...!</i>

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.140
It started out as a simple crush

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.180
Suddenly, you were my biggest source of strength

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.810
Till death do us part, let's grow old together

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:12.060
This is my sincerest wish:

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:14.150
Stay with me, stay with me

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.820
So long time, by my side for all eternity

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.030
Beaten down by our daily struggles

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:23.450
Or soaked by a storm of rage;

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.410
If you get drenched, I won't hesitate

00:11:26.410 --> 00:11:28.790
To be the umbrella that shields you

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.500
It's not so cold... I'm by your side

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.960
That's good enough for me

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:37.130
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:41.010
That smile of yours puts my soul at ease

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:43.430
I could search the whole world over

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.510
And find no one like you

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:48.520
You're my rock, my strength

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:52.480
Just the sight of you fills my heart with joy

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.690
No matter how much it may hurt,

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.730
I pledge my life to protecting you

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.990
Dear Sir Peter Grill,

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.900
I received a letter from Luvellia-san the other day...

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.990
Episode       Peter Grill and the Treaty's Aftermath

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.280
Did something happen?
